{"ticker":"JBHT","updated":"2026-10-23T23:10:32Z","profile":{"longName":"J.B. Hunt Transport Services, Inc.","shortName":"J.B. Hunt Transport Services, I","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Integrated Freight & Logistics","country":"United States","website":"https://www.jbhunt.com","fullTimeEmployees":31750,"marketCap":21227593728,"trailingPE":31.880112,"forwardPE":22.983747,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.5930389,"pegRatio":1.54,"targetMeanPrice":279.52173,"targetHighPrice":330.0,"targetLowPrice":187.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":23,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.204,"earningsGrowth":0.034,"grossMargins":0.17884001,"operatingMargins":0.0672,"profitMargins":0.05074,"totalRevenue":13325219840,"beta":1.311,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":299.76,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":157.82,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.78},"summary":"J.B. Hunt Transport Services, Inc. provides surface transportation, delivery, and logistic services in the United States. It operates through five segments: Intermodal, Dedicated Contract Services, Integrated Capacity Solutions, Final Mile Services, and Truckload. The JBI segment offers intermodal freight solutions. It operates 124,838 pieces of company-owned trailing equipment; owns and maintains its chassis fleet of 104,474 units; and manages a fleet of 5,880 company-owned tractors, 308 independent contractor trucks, and 8,704 company drivers. The DCS segment designs, develops, and executes supply chain solutions that support various transportation networks. As of December 31, 2025, it operated 11,878 company-owned trucks, 761 customer-owned trucks, and a contractor trucks. It operates 26,767 owned pieces of trailing equipment and 5,218 customer-owned trailers. The ICS segment provides freight brokerage and transportation logistics solutions; flatbed, refrigerated, expedited, and less-than-truckload, as well as dry-van and intermodal solutions; online multimodal marketplace; and logistics management services for customers to outsource their transportation functions. The FMS segment delivers services through 1,085 company-owned trucks, 169 customer-owned trucks, and 39 independent contractor trucks; and 1,091 owned pieces of trailing equipment and 98 customer-owned trailers. T","summary_zh":"J.B. Hunt Transport Services, Inc. 在美國提供地面運輸、送貨和物流服務。它透過五個部門運作：多式聯運、專用合約服務、綜合容量解決方案、最後一哩服務和卡車裝載。 JBI 部門提供聯運貨運解決方案。營運124,838台公司自有拖車設備；擁有並維護 104,474 輛底盤車隊；管理著一支由 5,880 輛公司自有拖拉機、308 輛獨立承包商卡車和 8,704 名公司司機組成的車隊。 DCS 部門設計、開發和執行支援各種運輸網路的供應鏈解決方案。截至2025年12月31日，該公司營運11,878輛公司自有卡車、761輛客戶自有卡車和承包商卡車。該公司營運 26,767 輛自有拖車設備和 5,218 輛客戶自有拖車。 ICS 部門提供貨運經紀和運輸物流解決方案；平板車、冷藏車、加急車和零擔車，以及乾貨車和聯運解決方案；線上多式聯運市場；為客戶外包其運輸職能的物流管理服務。 FMS 部門透過 1,085 輛公司自有卡車、169 輛客戶自有卡車和 39 輛獨立承包商卡車提供服務； 1,091 件自有拖車設備和 98 輛客戶自有拖車。時間","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"綜合貨運及物流","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":149.03,"h":149.1,"l":142.69,"c":142.75,"v":2156000},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":141.98,"h":144.45,"l":140.79,"c":144.32,"v":1399300},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":144.04,"h":146.64,"l":143.6,"c":145.79,"v":1211700},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":146.06,"h":147.03,"l":142.92,"c":143.98,"v":1213400},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":143.77,"h":145.41,"l":143.35,"c":144.99,"v":785400},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":142.96,"h":144.32,"l":142.63,"c":144.25,"v":864000},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":143.56,"h":145.39,"l":143.27,"c":145.38,"v":770900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":145.33,"h":145.5,"l":141.3,"c":145.28,"v":930400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":142.87,"h":147.97,"l":142.75,"c":143.73,"v":891800},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":143.54,"h":143.73,"l":140.48,"c":142.99,"v":1445600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":142.86,"h":142.86,"l":140.35,"c":141.0,"v":694400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":140.34,"h":141.26,"l":135.69,"c":136.94,"v":1345600},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":136.61,"h":141.9,"l":135.73,"c":141.45,"v":1084200},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":141.36,"h":141.36,"l":137.76,"c":137.93,"v":652700},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":138.44,"h":138.44,"l":135.78,"c":136.35,"v":1017000},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":136.94,"h":137.98,"l":136.21,"c":137.8,"v":964